{"updated":"2026-09-06T17:58:09.701Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: German far-right set for big win in eastern state - projections. Elsewhere, jamaican delegates arrive in UK to hand slavery reparations petition to King Charles. And palestinian farmers battle settler sabotage to save Hebron crops, livestock. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Ukraine, and Iran are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 0.2 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 1.2 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 0.3 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 35 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.6 near 93 km SE of Kirakira, Solomon Islands. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.16,0.21,0.24,0.29,0.35,0.4,0.43,0.48,0.52,0.56,0.58,0.61,0.64,0.69,0.81,0.91,1.06,1.38,1.5,1.54,1.58,1.6,1.65,1.67,1.7,1.72,1.76,1.81,1.88,1.94,1.99,2.02,2.06,2.1,2.14,2.17,2.23,2.28,2.32,2.36,2.4,2.45,2.5,2.54,2.59,2.65,2.72,2.79,2.9,3.02,3.17,3.2,3.25,3.27,3.33,3.38,3.44,3.53,3.61,3.67,3.74,3.77,3.83,3.88,3.92,3.97,3.99,4.03,4.08,4.1,4.12,4.14,4.19,4.24,4.32,4.38,4.45,4.53,4.59,4.7,4.75,4.81,4.83,4.89,5,5.16,5.33,5.84,5.92,6,6.06,6.12,6.17,6.22,6.3,6.37,6.49,6.54,6.61,6.66,6.72,6.77,6.82,6.87,6.95,7.01,7.13,7.16,7.21,7.25,7.28,7.31,7.37,7.41,7.49,7.54,7.61,7.65,7.77,7.84,7.89,7.93,7.96,8.06,8.12,8.16,8.22,8.28,8.32,8.37,8.41,8.47,8.53,8.62,8.73,8.79,8.94,8.99,9.02,9.2,9.25,9.3,9.36,9.43,9.51,9.57,9.63,9.67,9.72,9.8,9.95,10.1,10.7,10.82,10.88,10.94,10.99,11.03,11.09,11.12,11.18,11.26,11.3,11.45,11.52,11.59,11.64,11.69,11.74,11.8,11.87,11.9,11.96,11.99,12.07,12.12,12.18,12.22,12.28,12.33,12.37,12.4,12.43,12.48,12.54,12.6,12.68,12.74,12.77,12.81,12.84,12.88,12.99,13.14,13.26,13.43,13.47,13.5,13.58,13.62,13.69,13.73,